  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "66fe14a4-7e56-7bdd-9b8f-531e73dffe3c",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "cb0cf196-8ccf-5c20-d3d4-a21e6175b05f",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "According to FNF, the policy paper gives an in-depth examination of the state of press freedom within the Kenyan media landscape and delves into the intricate challenges and the complex interplay of factors that have impeded the realization of full press freedom in Kenya, offering a comprehensive analysis and policy recommendations.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Prof. Nyabuga has almost 20 years' experience teaching in higher education. He taught journalism, and media and cultural studies at the University of Worcester, and international media and communication, and comparative politics at Coventry University both in the United Kingdom. He worked as a journalist before joining academia, his last position in the media being the Managing Editor in charge of Weekend Editions, and Managing Editor, Media Convergence, at the Standard Group. Prof. Nyabuga's research interests include the sociology of journalism, new and digital media, communication, journalism and media theories, comparative media systems, and media, journalism, politics and democracy. He has a PhD in Media, Politics and History from Coventry University.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "To access the paper click ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "https://www.freiheit.org/publikation/media-under-pressure",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "link",
                      "attrs": {
                        "href": "https://www.freiheit.org/publikation/media-under-pressure",
